{"id":"436038","name":"蟹棒白菜粉丝汤","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/436038/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜","amount":"200g"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"50g(干)"},{"name":"蟹棒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"植物油","amount":"20g"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"醋","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"鲜鸡汁","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白菜切丝，蟹棒切段，葱切片，姜切丝备用。","img":"images/436038/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"炒锅放油烧热先煸姜丝。","img":"images/436038/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再放入葱花。","img":"images/436038/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入白菜翻炒。","img":"images/436038/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"白菜炒软后放入生抽，醋，鸡汁。","img":"images/436038/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加水煮开。","img":"images/436038/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入蟹棒煮软。","img":"images/436038/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入粉丝煮软。","img":"images/436038/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放盐调味即可。","img":"images/436038/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}